{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Widget Project 是一款為 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 而設的小工具應用程式，透過即時音樂、電量、天氣、行事曆、開支與自訂相片等元件，把日常資訊集中在主畫面、鎖定畫面與桌面。它適合希望統一整理個人資訊、快速掌握行程與狀態的 Apple 用戶。原價 US $4.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-199.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多裝置資訊儀錶板</h2>\n<p>Widget Project 提供多款小工具，包括即時音樂播放、電量狀態、天氣預報、行事曆、開支預算、倒數與世界時鐘，並可加入相片、檔案及磨砂玻璃便條。用戶可在 iPhone 主畫面與鎖定畫面、iPad 畫布及 Mac 桌面或選單列自由組合小、中型版面，配合淺色與深色模式，建立清晰一致的資訊儀錶板。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-40.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-41.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-42.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-43.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Widget Project</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/widget-project/id6827420455?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:23:01.772876+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:58:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T18:15:18.570139+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T15:16:36.627297+00:00","content_hash":"4acfcf72d1cbbf882cce8af030918a5b561b75af0703793b41fba38f9b64d54e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}